data: {"level":2,"reviewed":{"level":2,"label":"formula / approach","text":"Project with `y = x @ W.T + b`, because the weights are stored as `(out, in)`. Divide the feature\naxis into `num_heads` blocks of width `d_k = d_model // num_heads`. Each head computes\n`softmax(Q_j K_j^T / sqrt(d_k)) V_j`. After the heads are joined, apply the output projection. Check\nevery rule before computing: the rank, the weight and bias shapes, the head count, and the mask."},"hints_note":null}

